        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daria Morgendorffer\n- Works: Carousel (comics), Waiting for Godot, Masterpiece Comics\n- Organizations: MTV\n- Topics: comic adaptations, literature classics, animated series\n\nFacts:\n- Carousel (comics) is the host of the series title \"Masterpiece Comics.\"\n- Masterpiece Comics presents comic adaptations of literature classics.\n- One Masterpiece Comics adaptation mixes Waiting for Godot with MTV's animated series featuring Daria Morgendorffer.\n- Daria Morgendorffer is a character in MTV's animated series.\n- The mixed adaptation becomes \"Waiting for Godot.\"",
